cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the
  metadata from this file.
title: CLIMAAX CRA Handbook
abstract: >-
  The CLIMAAX project has developed a methodological
  framework for climate risk assessment (CRA) and a
  supporting toolbox. The software implementation of the
  combined framework and toolbox is known as the CLIMAAX CRA
  Handbook.
authors:
  - name: CLIMAAX
    website: 'https://www.climaax.eu'
type: software
